<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A6.SS2.SSS0.Px6" title="In F.2 Transfer Learning Experiments ‣ Appendix F Epistemic Sensitivity to Data Quality: Supplementary Details ‣ Not Just How Much, But Where: Decomposing Epistemic Uncertainty into Per-Class Contributions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Effect of rank constraint on uncertainty scale.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A6.SS3" title="In Appendix F Epistemic Sensitivity to Data Quality: Supplementary Details ‣ Not Just How Much, But Where: Decomposing Epistemic Uncertainty into Per-Class Contributions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F.3 </span>Sensitivity to Class Cardinality</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A6.SS3.SSS0.Px1" title="In F.3 Sensitivity to Class Cardinality ‣ Appendix F Epistemic Sensitivity to Data Quality: Supplementary Details ‣ Not Just How Much, But Where: Decomposing Epistemic Uncertainty into Per-Class Contributions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Mitigation strategies.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
