<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#S3.SS1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" title="Data. ‣ 3.1 Experimental Setup ‣ 3 Selective Prediction for Diabetic Retinopathy ‣ Not Just How Much, But Where: Decomposing Epistemic Uncertainty into Per-Class Contributions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§3.1</span></a>.
</span></li>
