<section id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Disentanglement ratios: CIFAR-10 transfer.</h4>

<div id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A6.T23" title="Table 23 ‣ Disentanglement ratios: CIFAR-10 transfer. ‣ F.2 Transfer Learning Experiments ‣ Appendix F Epistemic Sensitivity to Data Quality: Supplementary Details ‣ Not Just How Much, But Where: Decomposing Epistemic Uncertainty into Per-Class Contributions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">23</span></a> shows that under transfer learning MI outperforms <math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{k}C_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{k}C_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> for the low-rank model at all noise levels (<math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|R_{\mathrm{rel}}|=1.83" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>rel</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1.83</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|R_{\mathrm{rel}}|=1.83</annotation></semantics></math> vs. <math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1.97" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>1.97</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1.97</annotation></semantics></math> at <math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha{=}0.1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha{=}0.1</annotation></semantics></math>), consistent with the high inflation of this configuration.
For full-rank models, <math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{k}C_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{k}C_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> overtakes MI at <math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha\geq 0.2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha\geq 0.2</annotation></semantics></math>.
MC dropout shows the worst overall ratios (<math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.18" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.18</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.18</annotation></semantics></math>–<math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.90" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.90</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.90</annotation></semantics></math>), with <math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{k}C_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{k}C_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> recovering at high noise (<math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha\geq 0.4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha\geq 0.4</annotation></semantics></math>).
The model ordering for disentanglement quality is consistent: low-rank best under end-to-end training but worst under transfer, full-rank intermediate, MC dropout worst overall.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A6.T23" class="ltx_table">
