<section id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Disentanglement ratios: CIFAR-100 transfer.</h4>

<div id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A6.T24" title="Table 24 ‣ Disentanglement ratios: CIFAR-100 transfer. ‣ F.2 Transfer Learning Experiments ‣ Appendix F Epistemic Sensitivity to Data Quality: Supplementary Details ‣ Not Just How Much, But Where: Decomposing Epistemic Uncertainty into Per-Class Contributions" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a> extends the analysis to <math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K{=}100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K{=}100</annotation></semantics></math>.
Low-rank achieves strong disentanglement (<math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|R_{\mathrm{rel}}|&lt;0.37" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>rel</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.37</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|R_{\mathrm{rel}}|&lt;0.37</annotation></semantics></math>) for both metrics at all noise levels, with <math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{k}C_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{k}C_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> winning at every <math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>.
Full-rank shows MI winning at low noise but <math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{k}C_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{k}C_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> recovering at <math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha\geq 0.4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha\geq 0.4</annotation></semantics></math>.
MC dropout is the worst configuration: MI wins at all noise levels, with ratios exceeding <math id="A6.SS2.SSS0.Px4.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.58" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>0.58</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.58</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A6.T24" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 24: </span><math id="A6.T24.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|R_{\mathrm{rel}}(\alpha)|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>rel</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|R_{\mathrm{rel}}(\alpha)|</annotation></semantics></math> for CIFAR-100 (<math id="A6.T24.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K{=}100" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K{=}100</annotation></semantics></math>, transfer learning). Values <math id="A6.T24.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;0.3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;0.3</annotation></semantics></math> in <span id="A6.T24.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>. <math id="A6.T24.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dagger" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>†</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dagger</annotation></semantics></math>: <math id="A6.T24.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{k}C_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{k}C_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> outperforms MI.</figcaption>
<table id="A6.T24.4" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A6.T24.4.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A6.T24.4.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"></th>
<th id="A6.T24.4.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" colspan="2"><span id="A6.T24.4.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Low-rank</span></th>
